# PlacementIQ backend configuration

Set environment variables before running the app.

## Backend `.env` example
```env
APP_ENV=development
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
MODEL_ROOT_PATH=..
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
```

## Frontend `.env.example`
```env
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
```
